# Controllers

## Conventions

- Max 5 lines per action (enforced by RuboCop)
- RESTful actions only: index, show, new, create, edit, update, destroy
- No JSON/API responses - HTML and Turbo Streams only
- Use `respond_to` with `format.html` and `format.turbo_stream`
- Delegate business logic to models or service objects
- Use `before_action` for shared setup (set_*, find_*, authenticate_*)
- Private methods for params filtering (*_params)

## Routing

```ruby
# All routes must be within resources/resource blocks
resources :items, only: [:index, :show, :new, :create, :edit, :update, :destroy]

# Nested resources for relationships
resources :users do
  resources :bookings, only: [:index, :show]
end
```

